WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.029
This is the Prompt Studio, at Level 1, on the Claude Pro plan.

00:00:04.029 --> 00:00:07.900
It turns your idea into a complete, well structured prompt for Claude.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:14.150
The switches at the top change the level and the plan, and the Audio guide button opens the narrated walkthrough.

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:19.543
On Pro you have more room in each session, and you can use Projects.

00:00:19.543 --> 00:00:21.596
Create a Project for your prototype.

00:00:21.596 --> 00:00:27.867
The Project instructions box fills itself in from your design system and your answers, ready to paste into it.

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:30.949
Next, choose a design system.

00:00:30.949 --> 00:00:35.967
Use the filters to narrow the list, press Preview to see a sample screen, then press Select.

00:00:35.967 --> 00:00:38.367
Your choice flows straight into your prompt.

00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:41.192
Now the prompt builder.

00:00:41.192 --> 00:00:42.451
Not sure what to write?

00:00:42.451 --> 00:00:44.311
Press an example to fill the form.

00:00:44.311 --> 00:00:48.853
Then make it yours: your idea, your users, the main task, and the screens it needs.

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:53.820
Choose the device and fidelity, then the output format.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.588
One HTML file is the easiest.

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:59.917
Tick Ready for Desktop Tester if you'll run your user test in that app.

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:03.556
Your prompt builds live on the right.

00:01:03.556 --> 00:01:07.791
Press Copy prompt, and paste it into a new Claude chat inside your Project.

00:01:07.791 --> 00:01:09.767
Check Claude's plan, then reply go.

00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:14.746
Back in Your plan, the Project instructions have now filled in.

00:01:14.746 --> 00:01:18.863
Copy them into your Project, so every chat inside it starts already briefed.

00:01:20.433 --> 00:01:24.590
After your first build, use the prompt library for small, precise fixes.

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:27.188
Each prompt already names your design system.

00:01:27.188 --> 00:01:30.883
Replace the square brackets with your own details, then copy it.

00:01:32.433 --> 00:01:36.930
If something goes wrong, Troubleshooting has fixes for the most common problems.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.190
Download every working version, so you can always go back.

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:41.033
That's Level 1.
